* Agl_HSMFC155 LED Model Green/Red Bi-Colour LED
* Created by Shaun Quin 03-06-2002
*Typ Green: Vf=2.2V Vr=5V If=20mA 
*Typ Red LED: Vf=2.1V Vr=5V If=20mA 
*	       	    Green LED Anode
*	        	    |  Green LED Cathode
*	       	    |  |  Red LED Anode
*	        	    |  |  |  Red LED Cathode
*	       	    |  |  |  |
*           	   A1 K1 A2 K2
.subckt Agl_HSMFC155 1  2  3  4

D_Green 1 2 Agl_HSMGC110
D_Red   3 4 Agl_HSMSC110

.MODEL Agl_HSMGC110 D (IS=513.7n RS=89.63 N=1.5 BV=5 IBV=100U
+ CJO=9P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)

.MODEL Agl_HSMSC110 D (IS=513.7n RS=84.63 N=1.5 BV=5 IBV=100U
+ CJO=5P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)

*Temperature and Noise Effects are not Modelled

.ends Agl_HSMFC155








